                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 104,
                            "last_played": 1791838870
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The overall review score should be lower than mostly positive for this game because, besides it being a mediocre old game, is a broken and not working out of the box game. I managed to get to this in game time to write this by installing legacy PhysX 2013, downloading a mod pack and modifying the launching .exe in the properties. And as I've said before: a lot of tinkering for a mediocre game.\n\nIt's the first game of this kind from the Spiders Studio, known for doing mediocre, but, in a way charming, RPGs and refining their systems with each new title and setting. This one lacks an interesting story, lacks voice acting, the writing is bad and dragged on and the combat is as simple as turn based can get.\n\nIf you don't feel like trying everything Spiders had made, like I did, don't buy this one, it's not an enjoyable experience.",
